<view class="page"><view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="title">斌斌数据研究院</text><text class="pill">{{status}}</text></view><view class="muted">排列5 · 前四位开奖研究</view><view class="balls"><view class="ball" wx:for="{{balls}}" wx:key="index">{{item}}</view></view><view class="muted">{{issueText}}</view><view class="muted">{{dateText}}</view><view class="muted">最近检查：{{checkedAt}}</view><button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="refresh">检查开奖更新</button></view><view class="card"><text class="title">历史数据概览</text><view class="stats"><view class="stat"><text class="muted">历史期数</text><text class="value">{{count}}</text></view><view class="stat"><text class="muted">最后保存号码</text><text class="value number">{{latest}}</text></view></view></view><view class="card"><text class="title">最近自动同步开奖</text><view wx:if="{{recent.length}}"><view class="row" wx:for="{{recent}}" wx:key="issue" style="padding:18rpx 0;border-bottom:1rpx solid #25415e"><text class="muted">{{item.issue}}期 · {{item.date}}</text><text class="number">{{item.front4}}</text></view></view><view wx:else class="muted" style="margin-top:20rpx">暂无自动追加记录。当前展示的历史末期不代表今日开奖结果。</view></view><view class="muted">数据来自公开镜像，非官方实时直播。开奖号码请以中国体育彩票正式公告为准；小程序不提供彩票销售或代购。</view></view>